    "public": false,
    "input": "\"{\\\"message\\\": \\\"What is the average attack of all fire pokemon with defense lower 100? Search for type 1 and type 2\\\"}\"",
    "output": "\"Hello, Trainer! This is Professor Oak speaking. I'm quite intrigued by your query about Fire-type Pokémon and their defensive statistics. To get the precise data, I've asked my Tech Data Agent, a specialist in aggregations, to calculate this for us.\\n\\nBased on the agent's analysis, here are the results:\\n\\n**Average Attack of Fire-type Pokémon with Defense < 100**\\n- **Average Attack Stat:** **79.5**\\n\\nThis calculation includes Fire-types found in either **Type 1** or **Type 2** slots and considered only default forms (filtering out alternate forms like Mega Evolutions for this baseline).\\n\\nIt's interesting to note that while fire is a powerful offensive type, many of its members maintain a balanced or lower defense stat, making them reliant on speed and offensive pressure.\\n\\nKeep up the scientific curiosity! If you have any more questions about Pokémon, I'm here to help coordinate with my team.\"",
    "createdAt": "2026-04-04T21:11:01.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-04-04T21:11:14.436Z",
